  "part": {
    "name": "Aerodynamic housing with thumbwheel in pocket",
    "description": "Two-solid CAD part: a streamlined main housing (outer shell with bottom base and a rear end face) plus a small toroidal wheel/roller retained in a rectangular pocket/slot on the upper surface.",
